Subject: [PATCH 2/2] gomail-server: address add test kills the unsigned-cert
 mutant, cause in message

TestAddressAddForgedCert gains a case with a wrong signature and the
unchanged, revoked identity_gen 1 (without the signature check it ends
with adminRevoked and exit status 2) and a case with identity_gen above
the pin without a logged identity-<g>.succ. "address add" appends the
cause from identityKey, Verify and CheckPlatform to adminCertInvalid;
the test checks the message with strings.Contains.

